  "description": "Cross-platform Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE, Bluetooth LE) library for .NET. Scan, connect, read, write and subscribe as a GATT client (central), or host a GATT server and advertise as a peripheral, on Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, iOS and Mac Catalyst. One API over WinRT, CoreBluetooth, BlueZ and Android; native libraries bundled; NativeAOT compatible; works with .NET MAUI. Free for non-commercial and non-production use under BUSL-1.1; commercial production use requires a license.",
